; The same devtest speed and latency run on M-Tec's own driver, for comparison.
; Boot your normal system (mtecscsi.device running), insert this disk, then:
;   Execute MCTEST:S/mtec-speed 1        (1 = the SCSI unit of the disk)
.key UNIT/A
MCTEST:C/devtest -bb mtecscsi.device <UNIT> >MCTEST:mtec.txt
Echo "The result is MCTEST:mtec.txt"
